# Issue: #86
Feature: Address Pull Request Comments
  Resolve eligible automated review threads while preserving human ownership and exact-head safety.

  Scenario: AC1 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When automated review remediation stage exercises this capability
    Then Given an unresolved automated-review thread with an actionable finding, when remediation runs, then the source is fixed and verified before reply and resolution.

  Scenario: AC2 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When automated review remediation stage exercises this capability
    Then Given an ambiguous or human-authored thread, when encountered, then it remains unresolved and delivery returns intervention.

  Scenario: AC3 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When automated review remediation stage exercises this capability
    Then Given a fix changes the head, when review continues, then the updated exact head is pushed and rechecked.

  Scenario: AC4 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When automated review remediation stage exercises this capability
    Then Given no eligible findings remain, when the stage completes, then control returns to open-pr.
